4.2. Construct 2 {#sec4dot2-pharmacy-06-00011}
----------------

Construct 2: This comprises of a statement that has no value to the person, as an example the statement 'Hemifacial spasm is common symptom associated with skin cancer'. Use 'true' or 'false' to the left of the question mark. The next question relates to relevance and significance to the student. The student is presented with two categories, scientific and public knowledge. The student should select the correct category from these two options.
